stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Discovered: Plugin Assembly Loaded
    Discovered --> Registered: Factory Registration
    Registered --> Instantiated: Window Match
    Instantiated --> Initialized: Init(ProgramEventArgs)
    Initialized --> Started: OnStart()
    Started --> EventsAttached: AttachEvent()
    EventsAttached --> Active: Subscriptions Active

    Active --> Processing: Event Received
    Processing --> Active: Handle Event

    Active --> Loop: 5-second timer
    Loop --> Active: OnLoop() executed

    Active --> HotkeyRefresh: Hotkey Changed
    HotkeyRefresh --> Active: ChangeHotKey()

    Active --> EventsDetached: Window Lost Focus
    EventsDetached --> Stopped: DetachEvent()
    Stopped --> Disposed: OnStop()
    Disposed --> [*]: Reader Released
